    <briefdescription>
<para>TCP communication manager class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides an interface to connect to a TCP server, send and receive messages asynchronously using QTcpSocket.</para>
<para>Emits signals to notify connection status, errors and message reception. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
